    "key": "AIN-151",
    "fields": {
      "summary": "[XDS] Resolve existing dashboard API route in shared-package boundary test",
      "description": {
        "type": "doc",
        "version": 1,
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Discovered while verifying AIN-150. Existing XDS package boundary test fails on committed src/components/UnderwritingDashboard.types.ts:338: DashboardConfiguration.filters.optionsPath hard-codes /api/underwriting/submissions/search. Confirmed the same line exists in HEAD; AIN-150 did not introduce it. Test: node --test test/package.test.mjs from EnsuredXDS. The shared-source guard disallows application API dependencies."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Acceptance: resolve ownership of the dashboard endpoint contract; remove the application-specific route from the shared component contract or document and implement a narrowly justified boundary rule without weakening runtime import/API isolation. Add regression evidence, preserve current dashboard behavior and pass the source-boundary test, manifest checks and packed-consumer build."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Related only, not a blocker for AIN-150: its CollapsibleSection change has independent executable regressions and makes no application API calls. Do not close broader dashboard/release outcomes from this bug fix."
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
